### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Corte de Cabelo",
  "description": "Serviços de corte e styling"
}

### Listar profissionais
GET http://localhost:3000/api/professionals

### Criar profissional
POST http://localhost:3000/api/professionals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "categoryId": "CATEGORIA_ID_AQUI",
  "address": "Rua das Flores, 123"
}

### Listar profissionais por categoria
GET http://localhost:3000/api/professionals/category/CATEGORIA_ID_AQUI

### Criar disponibilidade (dia 1 = segunda, 09:00 às 18:00)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/availabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalId": "PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI",
  "dayOfWeek": 1,
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "18:00"
}

### Obter horários disponíveis
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availabilities/slots?professionalId=PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI&date=2024-03-20T10:00:00.000Z

### Criar agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalId": "PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI",
  "clientName": "Maria Santos",
  "clientPhone": "11988887777",
  "date": "2024-03-20T14:00:00.000Z"
}

### Listar agendamentos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments

### Listar apenas pendentes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments?status=PENDING

### Confirmar agendamento
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/APPOINTMENT_ID_AQUI/confirm

### Cancelar agendamento
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/APPOINTMENT_ID_AQUI/cancel